---
description: Python backend conventions
globs: ["backend/**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Python 3.12+, ruff, mypy strict, pydantic v2.
- Type hints on every function. No exceptions.
- `logging`, never `print()`.
- Import from `quant.*`, never relative.
- Every new function ships with a pytest in `backend/tests/` mirroring its path.
- Surface errors: log + raise. Never swallow.